{
 "_about": [
  "ie2toee creature guidance for Icewind Dale (classic) and Icewind Dale: Enhanced Edition.",
  "Authored mapping rules only: IE animation ids (engine constants, see IESDP ANIMATE.IDS) -> ToEE model ids (art/meshes/meshes.mes) and",
  "ToEE prototype ids (rules/protos.tab), plus our own short labels. No game text, names, stats or art from either game.",
  "status: match = a ToEE model of the same creature; stand-in = a similar ToEE model (tinted/scaled); missing = no usable ToEE model.",
  "proto is the preferred template; the converter falls back to any player protos.tab entry using the same model.",
  "co8_model: a better model that ships with Circle of Eight (Co8) / Temple+ content packs, used when present in the player's meshes.mes."
 ],
